{"id":67480,"date":"2025-11-06T03:42:25","date_gmt":"2025-11-06T02:42:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67480"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:25:49","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:25:49","slug":"sharish-monsaraz-natur-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sharish-monsaraz-natur-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, tendo como palco a hist\u00f3rica vila medieval de <strong>Monsaraz<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Reguengos de Monsaraz<\/strong>, distrito de \u00c9vora. Sob o lema <em>\u00abCorrer entre o C\u00e9u e a Terra\u00bb<\/em>, o evento integra o calend\u00e1rio do circuito <strong>Best Trail Series<\/strong> e mant\u00e9m a certifica\u00e7\u00e3o junto da ATRP\/FPA, ITRA e UTMB Index.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e meta instaladas no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Castelo de Monsaraz<\/strong>, vais percorrer trilhos panor\u00e2micos que ligam as muralhas seculares, a Serra dos Motrinos e as margens do <strong>Grande Lago Alqueva<\/strong>. O programa competitivo divide-se entre o <strong>Trail 50K<\/strong> (2000m D+, partida \u00e0s 08:30, limite de 10 horas), o <strong>Trail 30K<\/strong> (1500m D+, 08:30), o <strong>Trail 20K<\/strong> (1000m D+, 09:00), o <strong>Trail 10K<\/strong> (600m D+, 09:30) e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (09:30).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Coorganizada pelo <strong>GD Piranhas do Alqueva \/ Sharish Gin<\/strong> e pela <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong>, a prova arranca na v\u00e9spera (5 de mar\u00e7o) com a abertura do secretariado e a tert\u00falia oficial na Destilaria Sharish Gin, em Reguengos de Monsaraz, garantindo abastecimentos estruturados em regime de semiautossufici\u00eancia e acompanhamento de tempos em direto. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Castelo de Monsaraz, Reguengos de Monsaraz, \u00c9vora<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail 50 km, Trail 30 km, Trail 20 km, Trail 10 km e Caminhada 10 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"dis