0e9 31\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027 e onde funciona o secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027. O secretariado funciona na sexta-feira (5 de mar\u00e7o, das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00) na Destilaria Sharish Gin, em Reguengos de Monsaraz, e no s\u00e1bado a partir das 06:30 no Castelo de Monsaraz.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais no Castelo de Monsaraz?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as dist\u00e2ncias partem do Castelo de Monsaraz: o Trail 50K (2000m D+) e o Trail 30K (1500m D+) arrancam \u00e0s 08:30; o Trail 20K (1000m D+) parte \u00e0s 09:00; e o Trail 10K (600m D+) juntamente com a Caminhada (10 km) partem \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De 1 a 8 de setembro de 2026 os valores s\u00e3o de 35 \u20ac (50K), 28 \u20ac (30K), 22 \u20ac (20K), 18 \u20ac (10K) e 15 \u20ac (Caminhada). At\u00e9 30 de novembro passam para 40 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac, 25 \u20ac, 20 \u20ac e 15 \u20ac, e at\u00e9 31 de janeiro de 2027 fixam-se em 45 \u20ac, 35 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac, 25 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido no percurso?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail 50K tem um tempo limite de 10 horas. Para as provas de 50K, 30K e 20K \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio com m\u00ednimo de 1L de l\u00edquidos, telem\u00f3vel funcional, manta t\u00e9rmica e apito, al\u00e9m de copo ou recipiente pr\u00f3prio pois n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e que certifica\u00e7\u00f5es atribui?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 coorganizada pelo GD Piranhas do Alqueva \/ Sharish Gin e pela Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events, integrando o circuito Best Trail Series, com atribui\u00e7\u00e3o de pontos ITRA (2 pontos nos 50K e 1 ponto nos 30K), UTMB Index e candidatura aos circuitos da ATRP\/FPA.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Castelo de Monsaraz\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Reguengos de Monsaraz\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Sharish Monsaraz Natur Trail 2027 realiza-se a 6 de mar\u00e7o em Monsaraz, com Trail de 50K, 30K, 20K, 10K e Caminhada. Inscreve-te na prova oficial do Alqueva!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-sharish-monsaraz-natur-trail-3.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 50K (Trail Ultra)\", \"price\": \"40.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/sharish-monsaraz-natur-trail-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 30K (Trail Longo)\", \"price\": \"30.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": 